  "name": "Pesto Trapanese",
  "text": "Pesto Trapanese\n\nPreparation Time: 12 minutes\n\nCooking time: 0 minutes\n\nYield: 4 - 6\n\nIngredients\n\n3 ripe tomatoes\n\n4 cloves of garlic,\n\n50 g (2 oz) basil leaves (plus extra to garnish),\n\n125 g (4 oz) blanched almonds (toasted),\n\n150 ml (1/4 pint) olive oil,\n\nsalt and pepper.\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Place all of the ingredients in a food processor and blend until they are smooth.\n\n2. Season with salt and pepper.\n\nNotes\n\nCan be kept in a lidded jar covered with olive oil for up to 5 days.",
